    {
      "text": "Place venison roast into a slow cooker and sprinkle with onion mixture. Stir together ketchup, water, Worcestershire sauce, soy sauce, chile-garlic sauce, pepper, salt, and liquid smoke in a small bowl until well combined; pour over venison.",
